Subject: Accept GOG's Hexen installer,
 setup_hexen_beyond_heretic_1.1_(42801).exe

GOG's Hexen installer (148062304 bytes, the same 42801 build number as
the Heretic installer gdp already knows) holds HEXEN.WAD 1.1 (20083672
bytes, md5 abb033caf81e26f12a2103e1fa25453f), the CD's data track as
game.gog and the CD music as Ogg Vorbis. It has no Deathkings. gdp did
not know it, so it gave nothing from it; it now unpacks it with
innoextract for hexen.wad, as for setup_heretic_shadow_of_the_serpent_riders.

Forwarded: not yet (candidate for Debian)

diff --git a/data/hexen.yaml b/data/hexen.yaml
--- a/data/hexen.yaml
+++ b/data/hexen.yaml
@@ -67,6 +67,13 @@ files:
     alternatives:
     - hexen.wad?1.1
 
+  # GOG.com installer (HEXEN.WAD 1.1, the CD's data track as game.gog, the
+  # CD music as Ogg Vorbis; no Deathkings)
+  setup_hexen_beyond_heretic_1.1_(42801).exe:
+    unpack:
+      format: innoextract
+    provides: ['hexen.wad?1.1']
+
   hexdd.wad:
     alternatives:
     - hexdd.wad?1.1
